{"chapters":[{"title":"Hash set of words, scan for prefixes","code":"class Trie:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.words = set()\n\n    def insert(self, word):\n        self.words.add(word)\n\n    def search(self, word):\n        return word in self.words\n\n    def startsWith(self, prefix):\n        return any(w.startswith(prefix) for w in self.words)","frames":[{"caption":"<strong>Hash set of words, scan for prefixes</strong> &mdash; insert/search O(L), startsWith O(n &middot; L) time, O(total characters) extra space. Running <code>t = Trie(); t.insert(\"apple\"); assert t.search(\"apple\") is True and t.search(\"app\") is False and t.startsWith(\"app\") is True; t.insert(\"app\") …</code>. Step through to watch the code work on this input.","line":2,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"self","label":"self","v":["T","r","i","e"],"cls":["","","",""]}],"vars":[["self","'Trie'",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>self.words = set()</code> &mdash; returns <code>None</code>; <code>self.words = set()</code>","line":3,"panels":[],"vars":[["self.words","set()",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>self.words.add(word)</code> &mdash; returns <code>None</code>; <code>'apple'</code> added to <code>self.words</code>; <code>word = 'apple'</code>","line":6,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"self.words","label":"self.words (set)","v":["apple"],"cls":[""],"noidx":true}],"vars":[["word","'apple'",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>return word in self.words</code> &mdash; returns <code>T</code>","line":9,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"self.words","label":"self.words (set)","v":["apple"],"cls":[""],"noidx":true}],"vars":[["word","'apple'",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>return word in self.words</code> &mdash; returns <code>F</code>; <code>word = 'app'</code>","line":9,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"self.words","label":"self.words (set)","v":["apple"],"cls":[""],"noidx":true}],"vars":[["word","'app'",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>return any(w.startswith(prefix) for w in self.words)</code> &mdash; calls <